{"2570580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ground Zero Hero", "steam_appid": 2570580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>GET YOUR FREAK ON</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/7fcac7994c5794ba4844476e670c4844.poster.avif?t=1787789344\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/7fcac7994c5794ba4844476e670c4844.webm?t=1787789344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/7fcac7994c5794ba4844476e670c4844.mp4?t=1787789344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget surviving the apocalypse. You’re here to dominate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ground Zero Hero</strong> drops you into a radioactive wasteland overrun with mutated creatures. Every enemy you destroy becomes fuel for your evolution. Absorb their remains, stack mutations, and build increasingly powerful and unpredictable combinations until you become an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a new experiment. Each build is a new monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, chaotic, and endlessly replayable, Ground Zero Hero blends <strong>bullet hell combat, roguelite progression, and survival mechanics</strong> into one addictive loop where every decision shapes your path to power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABSORB. MUTATE. EVOLVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/9eba953a3e80075b9cd24a9ad410c154.poster.avif?t=1787789344\" width=1170 height=708 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/9eba953a3e80075b9cd24a9ad410c154.webm?t=1787789344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/9eba953a3e80075b9cd24a9ad410c154.mp4?t=1787789344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy you defeat drops the raw material for your next transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack mutations, combine abilities, and create wildly different builds every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two playthroughs are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE OVERWHELMING HORDES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/7aa59c768c58d934f2b459b7b399b74b.poster.avif?t=1787789344\" width=1170 height=708 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/7aa59c768c58d934f2b459b7b399b74b.webm?t=1787789344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/7aa59c768c58d934f2b459b7b399b74b.mp4?t=1787789344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face massive, screen-filling waves of mutated enemies attacking from all directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave escalates. Each night gets deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, adapt, and push your build to its limits in pure bullet hell chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT, UPGRADE, DOMINATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/0a3257857f2ced55d29a56121b90956a.poster.avif?t=1787789344\" width=1170 height=708 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/0a3257857f2ced55d29a56121b90956a.webm?t=1787789344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/0a3257857f2ced55d29a56121b90956a.mp4?t=1787789344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources from fallen enemies and crack safes under pressure to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade across multiple progression paths, each offering powerful bonuses that shape your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build smart. Survive longer. Become unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/fd10ab8b18127b78e9508223886197a3.avif?t=1787789344\" width=1500 height=478 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action roguelite gameplay with deep replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet hell combat with massive enemy hordes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutation system with countless build combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ upgrades across multiple progression paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ unique enemies and evolving threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple biomes with dynamic environmental challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode for high-skill players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 challenges to complete and master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced runs designed for repeat play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique dark humor and ch